{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e11-scene-06",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "都给你破格转正了  (Promoted Ahead of Everyone)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stepping out of Chun Yuqiao's office in a daze, Bu Xiaogu asks Xingzi why their boss looked so upset while promoting her—and Xingzi bursts out laughing at how oblivious Xiaogu is. Listen to Xingzi and Bu Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "快去办手续啊，人事那边等着你呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总为什么生气啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "生气了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是不是我又做错什么事了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "就算他真生气，也不是因为你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我看他呀，现在是对你好到不知道怎么好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你这话是什么意思啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "都给你破格转正了，你还看不出来啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "堂堂魔鬼鱼，这点事都忍不住。别想了，快走吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "到底为什么生气，我去弄清楚！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我干了六七年了都没你得宠，走走走，快去！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "快去办手续啊，人事那边等着你呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hurry off and finish your paperwork — HR is waiting for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总为什么生气啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why did Mr Chun Yuqiao seem so angry just now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "生气了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Was he angry?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是不是我又做错什么事了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Could I have done something wrong again?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "就算他真生气，也不是因为你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even if he really is angry, it isn't because of anything you did wrong.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you sure?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我看他呀，现在是对你好到不知道怎么好了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you ask me, he treats you so well right now he barely knows how to act!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你这话是什么意思啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you mean by that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "都给你破格转正了，你还看不出来啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He bent the rules to make you permanent early — can't you tell?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "堂堂魔鬼鱼，这点事都忍不住。别想了，快走吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even the mighty Manta Ray couldn't hold back! Stop overthinking and go.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "到底为什么生气，我去弄清楚！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait — let me go back inside and figure out why he was upset!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我干了六七年了都没你得宠，走走走，快去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I've worked for him six or seven years without being half as favored — off you go!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
